  "scope": "The original primitive form of weight at least two and prime p greater than three constructs a genuine finite local coefficient extension, its actual finite discrete characteristic-p residue field and continuous integral/residual arithmetic representations. The integer span of the two compact basis orbits is proved finite, full, invariant, free and rank two. This discharges every lattice input of the existing integral/residual realization. Native conjugacy invariance proves the exact trace and determinant comparison. Literal entrywise reduction gives original reduced Fourier traces and weight determinants at all original good-prime norm Frobenius elements, and actual complex conjugation remains odd. No lattice, representation, Frobenius, finite-residue or continuity certificate is supplied by the source consumer. Residual irreducibility and large image, remaining local/regularity conditions, exceptional-prime scope, full original association, automorphy and literal higher symmetric-power continuation remain unresolved. Acceptance remains 16/20 and DUB-17--20 OPEN; full scratch and subsequent assembled verification are required."
